WEBVTT

00:10:28.702 --> 00:10:30.313
Is this really necessary?

00:10:30.337 --> 00:10:32.130
What are the risks?

00:10:32.154 --> 00:10:33.710
Are there other options?

00:10:33.734 --> 00:10:36.894
And what happens if I don't do anything?

00:10:37.334 --> 00:10:41.381
Ask them when your doctor
wants to send you to an MRI,

00:10:41.405 --> 00:10:43.698
when he prescribes antibiotics

00:10:43.722 --> 00:10:45.825
or suggests an operation.

00:10:46.282 --> 00:10:47.990
What we know from research

00:10:48.014 --> 00:10:51.204
is that one out of five
of you, 20 percent,

00:10:51.228 --> 00:10:53.759
will change your opinion on what to do.

00:10:54.624 --> 00:10:57.966
And by doing that, you will
not only have made your life

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:01.552
a whole lot easier,
and probably even better,